  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-03/29352_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6792.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">6</span><span class=\"s2\">月になりました(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ˙</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\">​˙ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">お知らせが沢山あります！最後まで見てください(</span><span class=\"s1\">^^</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">つ目は</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">日向坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46 2nd</span><span class=\"s2\">シングル「ドレミソラシド」</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">7</span><span class=\"s2\">月</span><span class=\"s1\">17</span><span class=\"s2\">日に発売決定！！！！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">31</span><span class=\"s2\">日に解禁されましたが、その前に日向坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">の公式</span><span class=\"s1\">Twitter</span><span class=\"s2\">の方で不思議な動画が投稿されていたのをご存知でしょうか？？</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ピアノ・ギター・トランペット・ヴァイオリンの</span><span class=\"s1\">4</span><span class=\"s2\">つの楽器でドレミの音階をそれぞれ演奏していたのですが</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">不思議なことに「ドレミ</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">ソ」とファが出ませんでした！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">この動画は今回のタイトル「ドレミソラシド」にちなんだ動画だったんですよ(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">タイトルの他にも発売形態・全国握手会＆個別握手会の日程が解禁されております！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">収録内容などの詳細は後日解禁されていく予定なのでそれまで楽しみにお待ちくださいませ</span><span class=\"s4\">🙂</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">詳しくはコチラの日向坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">公式ホームページをご覧下さい！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">↓↓↓</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/official/news/detail/R00010?ima=0000\">https://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/official/news/detail/R00010?ima=0000<span class=\"s5\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">つ目は</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今朝、情報解禁されました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">私、小坂菜緒の初主演・初映画が決定致しました</span><span class=\"s4\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">タイトルは「恐怖人形」です！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この通り、ジャパニーズホラー映画になっております！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今回、映画のお仕事を頂けて、本当に本当にすごく嬉しい気持ちでいっぱいです。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ドラマをほんのちょこっとと、舞台を</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">回やらせて頂いてから、ファンの皆さんに「演技上手くなったね」「演技してる色んな姿を見てみたい」など、、、たくさんのお声を頂いて。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それから演技について、すごく興味を持ち始めました。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">でも、まだまだ未熟者ですし不安だらけだったのですが、監督さんをはじめ共演者の方々に引っ張っていただきながら、今ある全力を出し切りました。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">とても良い作品になると思います</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">！</span></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p1\">今秋公開予定です！</p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">是非、楽しみにしていてください((</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s6\">॑</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s6\">॑</span><span class=\"s1\">*&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s2\">))</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">日向坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">への貢献にもなればいいな。。。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">また、お話出来ることが増えましたら、ブログでも書いていきますのでお待ちくださいね</span><span class=\"s4\">☺️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\">つ目は</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">5</span><span class=\"s2\">月</span><span class=\"s1\">31</span><span class=\"s2\">日に舞台「ザンビ」</span><span class=\"s1\">Blu-ray&amp;DVD</span><span class=\"s2\">が発売されました</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">！！！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-06-03/29352_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8030.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">懐かしきフリージア学園の制服(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ˙</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\">​˙ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ザンビプロジェクトの第</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">弾として始まった舞台「ザンビ」が皆さんのお家でも見れますよ！！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">私はチーム</span><span class=\"s1\">RED</span><span class=\"s2\">として参加していました！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">乃木坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">さんの山下美月さん・与田祐希さん</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">欅坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">さんの小林由依さん・土生瑞穂さん</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">日向坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">の齊藤京子さん・小坂菜緒</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">の</span><span class=\"s1\">6</span><span class=\"s2\">人で走り抜いたホラー舞台！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">もう半年も経つんですね</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">早いもんです。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">本当にすごく充実した舞台になっておりますので、是非お手に取っていただけたらと思います((</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s6\">॑</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s6\">॑</span><span class=\"s1\">*&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s2\">))</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">舞台裏のメイキング映像や、チーム</span><span class=\"s1\">RED</span><span class=\"s2\">・チーム</span><span class=\"s1\">BLUE</span><span class=\"s2\">の座談会が収録されている特典映像もついてます！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\">坂道が揃った舞台はこのザンビが初めてで、なかなか見れない組み合わせになっているでそこにも注目しながら見て欲しいなぁ(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">また会いたいなぁ</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">なんて(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">大好きなんです、</span><span class=\"s1\">5</span><span class=\"s2\">人のこと</span><span class=\"s4\">🙂💓</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">是非、見てね</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀。</span><span class=\"s1\">. </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> * .</span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> *&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">告知だけで、すごい量書いてしまいました。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 2