color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">もう<ruby>半年<rt>はんとし</rt></ruby>も<ruby>経<rt>た</rt></ruby>つんですね</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>早<rt>はや</rt></ruby>いもんです。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にすごく<ruby>充実<rt>じゅうじつ</rt></ruby>した<ruby>舞台<rt>ぶたい</rt></ruby>になっておりますので、<ruby>是非<rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby>お<ruby>手<rt>て</rt></ruby>に<ruby>取<rt>と</rt></ruby>っていただけたらと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います((</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s6\">॑</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s6\">॑</span><span class=\"s1\">*&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s2\">))</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>舞台裏<rt>ぶたいうら</rt></ruby>のメイキング<ruby>映像<rt>えいぞう</rt></ruby>や、チーム</span><span class=\"s1\">RED</span><span class=\"s2\">・チーム</span><span class=\"s1\">BLUE</span><span class=\"s2\">の<ruby>座談<rt>ざだん</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>が<ruby>収録<rt>しゅうろく</rt></ruby>されている<ruby>特典<rt>とくてん</rt></ruby><ruby>映像<rt>えいぞう</rt></ruby>もついてます！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>坂道<rt>さかみち</rt></ruby>が<ruby>揃<rt>そろ</rt></ruby>った<ruby>舞台<rt>ぶたい</rt></ruby>はこのザンビが<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めてで、なかなか<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>れない<ruby>組み合<rt>くみあ</rt></ruby>わせになっているでそこにも<ruby>注目<rt>ちゅうもく</rt></ruby>しながら<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>て<ruby>欲<rt>ほ</rt></ruby>しいなぁ(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">また<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いたいなぁ</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">なんて(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>大好<rt>だいす</rt></ruby>きなんです、</span><span class=\"s1\">5</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>のこと</span><span class=\"s4\">🙂💓</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>是非<rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby>、<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>てね</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀。</span><span class=\"s1\">. </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> * .</span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> *&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>告知<rt>こくち</rt></ruby>だけで、すごい<ruby>量<rt>りょう</rt></ruby><ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>いてしまいました。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これで<ruby>終<rt>お</rt></ruby>わってしまいたくないのですが、<ruby>流石<rt>さすが</rt></ruby>に<ruby>読み切<rt>よみき</rt></ruby>れなくなっちゃうので。。。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んでいただきありがとうございます</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>小坂<rt>こさか</rt></ruby><ruby>菜緒<rt>なお</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s1\">^._.^</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">#115</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>告知<rt>こくち</rt></ruby>だけのブログは<ruby>意外<rt>いがい</rt></ruby>と<ruby>久<rt>ひさ</rt></ruby>しぶり？？？かも？？</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">まだまだ<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>き<ruby>足<rt>た</rt></ruby>りないから、この<ruby>後<rt>のち</rt></ruby>も<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>て<ruby>欲<rt>ほ</rt></ruby>しい</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あ、このブログじゃないですよ？</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">この<ruby>後<rt>のち</rt></ruby>に<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>くブログですからね、スクロールしても<ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>も<ruby>出<rt>で</rt></ruby>てきませんよ(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ˙</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\">​˙ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">フリじゃないですからね。。。<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ほんとうに。。<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p><div dir=\"ltr\"></div></div>\n                    ",
